    "title": "Behind-the-scene look at the setup of the Capital City Fireworks show - NewsBreak",
    "text": "2 hours ago COLUMBIA, S.C. — With New Year's Eve upon us, here is a look at the behind-the-scenes look of who makes the Capital City’s annual fireworks celebration possible. Guy Bouknight, the Lead Pyrotechnic Operator with Munnerlyn Pyrotechnics, helped setup for the display. He says this year’s show will include approximately 700 fireworks shells designed to ring in the new year. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
